{
  "_comment": "OBSERVABILITY ONLY. Merge into your Claude Code settings.json to log EVERY hook event to $BUDDY_LOG via log_only.py, which touches nothing (no device I/O). Use ALONGSIDE settings.example.json to compare terminal event order against device actions in one timeline. Replace ABSOLUTE_PATH. Set $BUDDY_LOG to a file to enable; unset = no-op. Mute chatty events with BUDDY_LOG_EXCLUDE=MessageDisplay,FileChanged. There is no wildcard event name, so every event is listed explicitly; events Claude Code adds later must be added here too.",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 ABSOLUTE_PATH/integrations/claude-code/log_only.py"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Setup": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
